https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6f/River_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240308131020 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6f/River_Cave_400x800.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20240308131020 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"River Cave 400x800\" width=\"270\" height=\"135\" data-image-key=\"River_Cave_400x800.png\" data-image-name=\"River Cave 400x800.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Between Finlay and Ferwater</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"NPC\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">NPC</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lumi_Laurence\" title=\"Lumi Laurence\">Lumi Laurence</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Purpose\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Purpose</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">To get Prismarine, Lumite, Clay and Opal</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>River Caves</b> are between <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay</a>.\nThey are characterized by its thick fog. Along with the other River biomes, it is accessible via explodable walls right after the curved bridge leading to another section of <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> or also accessible via big waterfall to the right of the <a href=\"/wiki/Bridge\" title=\"Bridge\">Bridge</a> that leads to <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a>.\n</p><p>There is a <a href=\"/wiki/Lab\" title=\"Lab\">Lab</a> , a <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> and a possible <a href=\"/wiki/Pirate_Boat\" title=\"Pirate Boat\">Pirate Boat</a> spawn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Prismarine\" title=\"Prismarine\">Prismarine</a> nodes , found on land.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Clay\" title=\"Blue Clay\">Blue Clay</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Clay\" title=\"Red Clay\">Red Clay</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Brown_Clay\" title=\"Brown Clay\">Brown Clay</a> nodes , found in water.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lumite\" title=\"Lumite\">Lumite</a> nodes , found in prismarine.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Plek\" title=\"Plek\">Plek</a> , found in a smaller seperate cave in an underwater section , near the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a></li>\n<li>In one of the fishing sneak peeks on Discord, Hoofer displayed a fish being caught with the name Stone fish. It had a stone texture.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902150214\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 100/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1096/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019441/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.608      1 -total\n 85.58%   33.039      1 Template:Buildings\n  7.64%    2.949      1 Template:Stub\n  6.53%    2.523      1 Template:Outdated\n  3.33%    1.286      2 Template:Mainonly\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2301-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902150214 and revision id 21719. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Stubs","Outdated","Locations"],"links":[{"title":"Lumi Laurence","exists":true},{"title":"Blue Clay","exists":true},{"title":"Bridge","exists":true},{"title":"Brown Clay","exists":true},{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Finlay Island","exists":true},{"title":"Lab","exists":true},{"title":"Lumite","exists":true},{"title":"Pirate Boat","exists":true},{"title":"Plek","exists":true},{"title":"Prismarine","exists":true},{"title":"Red Clay","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Stubs","exists":true},{"title":"Category:Outdated","exists":true}],"images":["River_Cave_400x800.png"]}
